ponses`, and `opencode`, with `gpt-5.4` now the default for `openai` and `openai-codex` ([README.md](README.md), [docs/providers.md](docs/providers.md)).\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1618:- Added `gpt-5.4` model availability for `openai`, `openai-codex`, `azure-openai-responses`, and `opencode` providers.\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1624:- Updated the default models for the `openai` and `openai-codex` providers to `gpt-5.4`.\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1814:- Added `transport` setting (`\"sse\"`, `\"websocket\"`, `\"auto\"`) to `/settings` and `settings.json` for providers that support multiple transports (currently `openai-codex` via OpenAI Codex Responses).\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1911:- Replaced Claude Opus 4.5 with Opus 4.6 as default model ([#1345](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/pull/1345) by [@calvin-hpnet](https://github.com/calvin-hpnet))\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1977:- Fixed Bedrock default model ID from `us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-6-v1:0` to `us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-6-v1`\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1985:- Updated default model for `anthropic` provider to `claude-opus-4-6`\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1986:- Updated default model for `openai-codex` provider to `gpt-5.3-codex`\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1987:- Updated default model for `amazon-bedrock` provider to `us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-6-v1:0`\n/var/folders/m5/x5w9fw4929lbwqs1j_kndhbh0000gn/T/tmp.Ns8GPKMB7i/package/CHANGELOG.md:1988:- Updated default model for `vercel-ai-gateway` provider to `anthropic/claude-opus-4-6`\n/var/folders